BT 1 0 0 1 0 58 Tm /F2+0 9.5 Tf 13.5 TL (This folder contains the computational material used for the large underdetermined-system part of) Tj T* (my dissertation. The aim of the material is not simply to provide code that produces a set of) Tj T* (numbers. I have kept the Python benchmark and the plotting stage separate so that another) Tj T* (researcher can see what was calculated, reproduce the numerical runs, and regenerate the figures) Tj T* (and summary tables from the resulting CSV files.) Tj T* ET
