BT 1 0 0 1 0 44.5 Tm 13.5 TL 0 0 0 rg /F2+0 9.5 Tf 13.5 TL (The two Python files in this folder are Underdetermined.py and Underdetermined_Plots.py) Tj (. The first) Tj T* -0.063488 Tw (performs the numerical benchmark for one experiment and one solver at a time. The second collects) Tj T* 0 Tw (the completed results and produces the summaries and plots used for inspection. The other two) Tj T* (PDFs explain how to run the files and which computational conditions need to be respected.) Tj T* ET
