BT 1 0 0 1 0 44.5 Tm 13.5 TL 0 0 0 rg /F2+0 9.5 Tf 13.5 TL (For the experiments in this dissertation, the systems are synthetic. A known reference vector,) Tj T* (x_true) Tj (, is generated first. The matrix A is then generated according to the chosen dimensions,) Tj T* (sparsity, pattern, condition parameter and spectrum. The right-hand side is constructed from A and) Tj T* (x_true and includes a controlled noise level.) Tj T* ET
