q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 44.5 Tm 13.5 TL 0 0 0 rg /F2+0 9.5 Tf 13.5 TL (Because x_true is known, the calculation can be assessed using both the residual and the relative) Tj T* (error against that reference solution. In plain terms, the experiment asks how different numerical) Tj T* (methods behave when a large problem has many more unknowns than equations, and when the) Tj T* (structure of that problem is changed in a controlled way.) Tj T* ET
